## Format for every line:
##   [target config]:[project name 1] [project name 2]...
##   [project name] have four source:
##     1. ro.separate.soft
##     2. ro.build.product
##     3. /proc/oplusVersion/prjName
##     4. /proc/oplusVersion/prjVersion
##   [target config] is the name of folder which contains real config
## More over, we have some appendencies for other request:
##   If you have a region concern, you can write in this format
##     [target config]:[project name 1(REGION=TARGET1/TARGET2;FEATURE2=TARGET3/TARGET4)]...
##   Like:
##     19362_JP:19362(REGION=JP/TW;OPERATOR=VODAFONE)
##   Then we will find config from 19362_JP in japen version and 19362 in other
